{"id":"84d09aff18243439","group":"17","path":"17/17-thm-type-realization-elementary-extension.md","title":"Realization of Types in Elementary Extensions","display":"thm-type-realization-elementary-extension — Realization of Types in Elementary Extensions","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-thm-type-realization-elementary-extension","aliases":["17-thm-type-realization-elementary-extension"],"display":"thm-type-realization-elementary-extension — Realization of Types in Elementary Extensions","depends_on":["[[17-df-reduct]]","[[17-df-structure]]","[[17-df-elementary-substructure]]","[[17-df-diagram]]","[[17-df-elementary-diagram]]","[[17-df-type]]","[[17-df-type-realization]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","source_verification":"not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed","legacy_label":"17-thm-5.3.2","local_revision":"formal-interface repair from supplied text; inherited source_verification is not reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-thm-type-realization-elementary-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-thm-type-realization-elementary-extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-type-realization-elementary-extension — Realization of Types in Elementary Extensions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f48c896e5c0651df\" href=\"?note=f48c896e5c0651df\" title=\"17-df-reduct\">17-df-reduct</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"71ede582cb78a069\" href=\"?note=71ede582cb78a069\" title=\"17-df-elementary-substructure\">17-df-elementary-substructure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"45c3869fde7fe37f\" href=\"?note=45c3869fde7fe37f\" title=\"17-df-diagram\">17-df-diagram</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b664bed1223db216\" href=\"?note=b664bed1223db216\" title=\"17-df-elementary-diagram\">17-df-elementary-diagram</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"07adad8c036296f7\" href=\"?note=07adad8c036296f7\" title=\"17-df-type\">17-df-type</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a41374cf828233e6\" href=\"?note=a41374cf828233e6\" title=\"17-df-type-realization\">17-df-type-realization</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-thm-5.3.2"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"formal-interface repair from supplied text; inherited source_verification is not reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(L(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span> 中的候选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-型。名字 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_a=\\operatorname{Name}_L(a)\">\\(c_a=\\operatorname{Name}_L(a)\\)</span> 固定，在扩张中保持原参数的解释。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak B\\!\\upharpoonright L_0\">\\(\\mathfrak B\\!\\upharpoonright L_0\\)</span> is the canonical reduct from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f48c896e5c0651df\" href=\"?note=f48c896e5c0651df\" title=\"17-df-reduct\">17-df-reduct</a>, defined for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sublanguage}_{17}(L_0,L_1)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sublanguage}_{17}(L_0,L_1)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L_1)\">\\(\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L_1)\\)</span>. All reduct occurrences below use that language-pair interface.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span> (an <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-structure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(L(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_a\">\\(c_a\\)</span> (language naming <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"45c3869fde7fe37f\" href=\"?note=45c3869fde7fe37f\" title=\"17-df-diagram\">17-df-diagram</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ElemDiag}(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\operatorname{ElemDiag}(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span> (elementary diagram, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"b664bed1223db216\" href=\"?note=b664bed1223db216\" title=\"17-df-elementary-diagram\">17-df-elementary-diagram</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_n\">\\(S_n\\)</span> (complete-type space, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"07adad8c036296f7\" href=\"?note=07adad8c036296f7\" title=\"17-df-type\">17-df-type</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Realized}\">\\(\\operatorname{Realized}\\)</span> (type-realization predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"a41374cf828233e6\" href=\"?note=a41374cf828233e6\" title=\"17-df-type-realization\">17-df-type-realization</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preceq_L\">\\(\\preceq_L\\)</span> (elementary-substructure relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"71ede582cb78a069\" href=\"?note=71ede582cb78a069\" title=\"17-df-elementary-substructure\">17-df-elementary-substructure</a>)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n&amp;\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\n\\land\np\\in S_n\\bigl(\\operatorname{ElemDiag}(\\mathfrak A)\\bigr)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\to\n\\exists\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\n\\exists\\mathfrak B_{\\mathfrak A}\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L(\\mathfrak A))\n\\Bigl[\n\\mathfrak A\\preceq_L\\mathfrak B\n\\land\n\\mathfrak B_{\\mathfrak A}\\!\\upharpoonright L=\\mathfrak B\n\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{24mm}\\land\n\\forall a\\in|\\mathfrak A|\\;\n(c_a^{\\mathfrak B_{\\mathfrak A}}=a)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Realized}_{\\mathfrak B_{\\mathfrak A}}(p)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n&amp;\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\n\\land\np\\in S_n\\bigl(\\operatorname{ElemDiag}(\\mathfrak A)\\bigr)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\to\n\\exists\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\n\\exists\\mathfrak B_{\\mathfrak A}\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L(\\mathfrak A))\n\\Bigl[\n\\mathfrak A\\preceq_L\\mathfrak B\n\\land\n\\mathfrak B_{\\mathfrak A}\\!\\upharpoonright L=\\mathfrak B\n\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{24mm}\\land\n\\forall a\\in|\\mathfrak A|\\;\n(c_a^{\\mathfrak B_{\\mathfrak A}}=a)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Realized}_{\\mathfrak B_{\\mathfrak A}}(p)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The type is taken in the parameter language <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(L(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span> over the elementary diagram, and it is realized in the corresponding named expansion of an elementary extension. This avoids treating a type over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\)</span> as an unparameterized <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-type.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-reduct","status":"resolved","id":"f48c896e5c0651df","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-reduct]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-elementary-substructure","status":"resolved","id":"71ede582cb78a069","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-elementary-substructure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-diagram","status":"resolved","id":"45c3869fde7fe37f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-diagram]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-elementary-diagram","status":"resolved","id":"b664bed1223db216","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-elementary-diagram]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-type","status":"resolved","id":"07adad8c036296f7","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-type-realization","status":"resolved","id":"a41374cf828233e6","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-type-realization]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-reduct","status":"resolved","id":"f48c896e5c0651df","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak B\\!\\upharpoonright L_0$ is the canonical reduct from [[17-df-reduct]], defined for $\\operatorname{Sublanguage}_{17}(L_0,L_1)$ and $\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L_1)$. All reduct occurrences below use that language-pair interface.","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$ (an $L$-structure, see [[17-df-structure]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-diagram","status":"resolved","id":"45c3869fde7fe37f","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L(\\mathfrak A)$ and $c_a$ (language naming $|\\mathfrak A|$, see [[17-df-diagram]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-elementary-diagram","status":"resolved","id":"b664bed1223db216","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ElemDiag}(\\mathfrak A)$ (elementary diagram, see [[17-df-elementary-diagram]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-type","status":"resolved","id":"07adad8c036296f7","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S_n$ (complete-type space, see [[17-df-type]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-type-realization","status":"resolved","id":"a41374cf828233e6","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Realized}$ (type-realization predicate, see [[17-df-type-realization]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-elementary-substructure","status":"resolved","id":"71ede582cb78a069","anchor":"ref-14","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\preceq_L$ (elementary-substructure relation, see [[1